EXACT = {
    "城牆像一排書立，衛兵把每一次震動都記進冊裡。": "The walls stand like a row of bookends, and the guards write every tremor into a ledger.",
    "麵包屑比屋頂還大，倉房守衛願意聽一場好交易。": "Breadcrumbs are larger than rooftops, and the granary guards will listen to a good bargain.",
    "所有窗戶都映出同一座小王城，地圖上的街道熟悉得過分。": "Every window reflects the same small capital, and the streets on the map are too familiar.",
    "輕巧的火柴骨，威力 +1、機動 +1。": "A light matchstick frame: power +1, mobility +1.",
    "帶線軸的骨架，機動 +2，適合逃跑。": "A frame with a spool: mobility +2, good for escaping.",
    "頂針做成的重架，威力 +2、噪音 +1。": "A heavy frame made from a thimble: power +2, noise +1.",
    "針尖只夠刺進大人的指甲縫，威力 +2。": "The point is only long enough to slip under a giant's nail: power +2.",
    "一點胡椒就能換一聲噴嚏，威力 +1、噪音 +1。": "A pinch of pepper can buy a sneeze: power +1, noise +1.",
    "對大人可能只是抓癢，噪音 -1、機動 +1。": "To a giant it may only be a tickle: noise -1, mobility +1.",
    "從玩具拆下的發條，威力 +2、噪音 +1。": "A clockspring taken from a toy: power +2, noise +1.",
    "回彈快而安靜，威力 +1、機動 +1。": "It snaps back fast and quiet: power +1, mobility +1.",
    "吹氣推動，噪音 +1，本身不添威力。": "Driven by a puff of air: noise +1, and it adds no power of its own.",
    "好心的鞋匠看見了璿芃，只把一塊麵包皮推過來：「慢慢走。」": "A kind cobbler sees Xuanpeng and only pushes over a crust of bread: \"Go slowly.\"",
    "退休裁縫把線頭與鈕釦留給小人國，還指了一條不被看見的縫。": "A retired tailor leaves thread ends and buttons for Lilliput, and points out a seam that will not be seen.",
    "守夜人願意替你保守祕密，還說出衛兵換崗的空隙。": "A night watchman is willing to keep your secret, and even names the gap in the guard change.",
    "廚娘以為你是來討食物的精靈，故意把餅乾屑掃到桌腳。": "A cook takes you for a spirit come to beg food, and deliberately sweeps biscuit crumbs to the table leg.",
    "壞蛋學徒拿杯子追著你罩，還順走了行囊裡的銀幣。": "A scoundrel of an apprentice chases you with a cup and also lifts the silver from your pack.",
    "宮廷貓一掌拍碎了掩護，璿芃在灰塵裡跌得發昏。": "The palace cat smashes the cover with one paw, and Xuanpeng goes dizzy in the dust.",
    "有人在牆腳放了捕鼠夾；你掙脫了，但留下了一小片衣角。": "Someone set a mousetrap at the foot of the wall. You tear free, but leave a scrap of hem.",
    "書記官把所有失竊都記成「老鼠」，卻開始在夜裡撒下石灰。": "The clerk writes every theft down as \"mice,\" but starts scattering lime at night.",
    "征服": "Conquest",
    "盟約": "Pact",
    "鏡國": "Mirror",
    "逾期": "Overdue",
    "俘虜": "Captive",
    "斷糧": "Starved",
    "收令": "Orders withdrawn",
    "城門終於承認小人國的旗幟。璿芃把國王召令釘在比自己還高的門上。": "The gate at last recognizes Lilliput's banner. Xuanpeng pins the king's orders to a door taller than himself.",
    "大人國簽下歸附盟約。沒有破城，但印章落下的聲音一樣像雷。": "The giant kingdom signs a pact of allegiance. The walls were not broken, but the seal coming down still sounds like thunder.",
    "塵土散開後，被攻陷的好像是自己的小人國：那面旗、那道牆，連璿芃的家都在裡面。": "When the dust settles, the place that fell seems to be Lilliput itself: that flag, that wall, even Xuanpeng's home inside it.",
    "第五十二週過去了，國王等不到攻陷的消息，召令在燭火裡捲了邊。": "Week 52 has passed. The king receives no news of a conquest, and the orders curl at the edges in the candlelight.",
    "最後一次救援也沒有抵達。璿芃成了玻璃罐裡的「稀有老鼠」。": "The last rescue never arrives. Xuanpeng becomes a \"rare mouse\" in a glass jar.",
    "行囊空了，最後一點體力也用完。遠征先輸給了肚子。": "The pack is empty, and the last of the stamina is gone. The expedition loses first to the stomach.",
    "璿芃主動收起召令，這一年在這裡中止。": "Xuanpeng puts the orders away on purpose. This year ends here.",
    "結算": "Settlement",
    "四拍內閃對三次；成功後暴露 -2。": "Three clean dodges in four beats; on success, exposure -2.",
    "三拍內閃對兩次；沿路會丟掉 2 糧草。": "Two clean dodges in three beats; you will drop 2 rations along the way.",
    "四拍內閃對三次；成功後暴露 -3。": "Three clean dodges in four beats; on success, exposure -3.",
    "左側靴底橫掃過來，右邊還留著一道縫。": "A boot sole sweeps in from the left; a seam remains on the right.",
    "右側手指併攏壓下，左邊的桌腳可以藏身。": "Fingers close and press down from the right; the table leg on the left can hide you.",
    "整隻手掌從上方罩落，只有伏低才能躲過。": "A whole palm drops from above. Only ducking low will get you past it.",
    "國王只給一年：選一個大人國，用戰爭或外交讓它低頭。": "The king gives only one year: choose a giant kingdom, and make it bow by war or by diplomacy.",
    "1 週 · 1 糧草": "1 week · 1 ration",
    "善意 +2；會遇到好人或壞蛋。沒有主動發現判定。": "Goodwill +2; you may meet a kind stranger or a scoundrel. No active detection check.",
    "銀幣 +3；會遇到日常事件，適合籌措買糧或贖身費。": "Silver +3; a daily event may occur. Good for raising money to buy rations or pay a ransom.",
    "體力 +1、暴露 -2，不觸發日常事件。": "Stamina +1, exposure -2, and it does not trigger a daily event.",
    "進入工坊，分別選擇骨架、頭部與驅動；組裝才消耗一週。": "Enter the workshop and choose a frame, a head, and a drive; only assembly costs a week.",
    "糧草 +7、暴露 -2。銀幣不足時不會出現。": "Rations +7, exposure -2. It does not appear if you are short of silver.",
    "1 週 · 3 銀幣 · 1 糧草": "1 week · 3 silver · 1 ration",
    "1 週 · 1 銀幣 · 1 糧草": "1 week · 1 silver · 1 ration",
    "控制、武器威力與情報均已達標；立即結算戰爭結局。": "Control, weapon power, and intel all meet their marks; settle the war ending at once.",
    "影響、善意與情報均已達標；立即結算外交結局。": "Influence, goodwill, and intel all meet their marks; settle the diplomatic ending at once.",
    "清空這張設計圖，不消耗一週。": "Clear this blueprint. Does not cost a week.",
    "回到野外，不消耗一週。": "Return to the field. Does not cost a week.",
    "先選排水溝、麵包屑小徑或衣擺暗縫，再在拍數內輸入閃躲方向。": "First choose the gutter, the crumb trail, or the hem seam, then enter dodge directions within the beats.",
    "五拍內削弱追兵。游標越接近出手點，傷害越高；連續命中會累積 combo。": "Wear the pursuer down in five beats. The closer the cursor is to the strike point, the higher the damage; consecutive hits build combo.",
    "距離出手點越近越痛；命中後 combo +1。完全失手會挨反擊。": "The closer to the strike point, the more it hurts; a hit adds 1 combo. A complete miss draws a counter.",
    "保留 combo，不造成傷害，也不受這拍反擊；仍會消耗一回合。": "Keep the combo, deal no damage, and take no counter this beat; it still costs a round.",
    "消耗善意 2、情報 1，必定獲救。": "Spend 2 goodwill and 1 intel. Rescue is certain.",
    "花 4 銀幣換自由，必定成功。": "Spend 4 silver for freedom. Success is certain.",
    "行囊已空，這週只能挨餓：體力 -1。": "The pack is empty. This week you can only go hungry: stamina -1.",
    "第二次閃躲失誤，手指在面前合攏。": "A second missed dodge, and the fingers close in front of you.",
    "路線已到盡頭，但閃躲次數不夠。": "The route has run out, but you do not have enough clean dodges.",
    "小武器落在拇指上，說穿了還是像抓癢；這次靠的是時機與連擊。": "The tiny weapon lands on a thumb. Truth be told, it still feels like a tickle; this time it is timing and the combo that carry it.",
    "重擊太早或太晚，大人只覺得被抓癢。combo 歸零。": "The heavy strike is too early or too late. The giant only feels a tickle. Combo resets.",
    "快擊落空，連武器碰沒碰到都沒人確定。combo 歸零。": "The quick strike misses. No one can even tell whether the weapon connected. Combo resets.",
    "追兵終於縮回手。璿芃贏得這次迎戰，控制 +2、暴露 +1。": "The pursuer finally draws the hand back. Xuanpeng wins this duel: control +2, exposure +1.",
    "反擊耗盡了體力。": "The counter spends the last of the stamina.",
    "五拍已盡，追兵仍然站在面前。": "Five beats are gone, and the pursuer is still standing in front of you.",
    "曾受幫助的大人認出了記號，悄悄把玻璃罐打開。": "A giant who was once helped recognizes the mark, and quietly opens the jar.",
    "獄卒數著四枚銀幣，故意轉過頭去。": "The jailer counts four coins and deliberately turns away.",
    "牆縫裡伸來一根細線，小人國的同伴終於找到了玻璃罐。": "A thin thread comes out of a crack in the wall. Companions from Lilliput have finally found the jar.",
    "璿芃回本國買進七份糧草，再沿舊路潛回大人國。": "Xuanpeng returns home, buys seven rations, and slips back into the giant kingdom by the old road.",
    "大人只看見剩下的麵包又少了一角，嘟囔著：「又是老鼠。」": "The giant only sees that another corner of the leftover bread is gone, and mutters, \"Mice again.\"",
    "璿芃把巡邏空隙與倉房位置畫進小地圖：情報 +2、部件 +1。": "Xuanpeng sketches the gap in the patrol and the granary's place onto a tiny map: intel +2, parts +1.",
    "你替大人找回滾進縫裡的鈕釦。他沒看清你的臉，只記得這份善意。": "You fetch a button that rolled into a crack for a giant. He never sees your face clearly, and only remembers the goodwill.",
    "小人國最擅長修補大人看不見的小地方：銀幣 +3。": "Lilliput is best at mending the small places giants never see: silver +3.",
    "牆縫很窄，卻夠安全。體力 +1、暴露 -2。": "The crack in the wall is narrow, but safe enough. Stamina +1, exposure -2.",
    "日常事故耗盡了體力。": "A daily mishap spends the last of the stamina.",
    "攤開設計圖：先選骨架，再選頭部與驅動。": "Spread the blueprint: choose the frame first, then the head and the drive.",
    "把設計圖擦乾淨，重新選三個部件。": "Wipe the blueprint clean and choose the three parts again.",
    "設計圖先收起來，這一週還沒有花掉。": "Fold the blueprint away for now. This week has not been spent.",
    "對大人國而言，這可能真的只是一次抓癢。": "To a giant kingdom, this may truly be nothing more than a tickle.",
    "這件小東西至少有機會讓大人認真眨眼。": "This little thing at least has a chance of making a giant blink in earnest.",
    "璿芃轉身就跑。先選一條路線，之後每個 dodge 都是一拍。": "Xuanpeng turns and runs. First choose a route; after that, each dodge is one beat.",
    "先選一個大人國；戰爭或外交都可以完成召令。": "First choose a giant kingdom. War or diplomacy can both complete the orders.",
    "尚未組裝武器。沒有武器也能迎戰，但重擊少了威力。": "No weapon has been assembled yet. You can still duel without one, but a heavy strike will lack power.",
    "被發現了": "Spotted",
    "巨大的影子停在頭頂。逃跑進入路線/閃躲，迎戰進入時機/連擊。": "A huge shadow stops over your head. Escape goes into route / dodge; a fight goes into timing / combo.",
    "先選路線。每條路線的拍數與所需閃躲次數不同。": "Choose a route first. Each route has a different beat count and a different number of required dodges.",
    "武器機動 ≥3 時，路線所需成功數 -1。": "When weapon mobility is ≥3, the route's required successes drop by 1.",
    "迎戰時機": "Duel timing",
    "玻璃罐": "Glass jar",
    "尚未選擇大人國": "No giant kingdom chosen yet",
    "國王召令 · 璿芃必須在一年內攻陷一個大人國": "The king's orders · Xuanpeng must conquer a giant kingdom within one year",
    "王令": "Royal orders",
    "武器設計": "Weapon design",
    "記下": "Notes",
    "每週消耗 1": "Costs 1 each week",
    "提高發現率": "Raises detection",
    "這局把週數花在補給或準備上，卻沒有在第五十二週前主動攻陷。下局要更早對照門檻。": "This run spent its weeks on supply or preparation, and never moved to conquer before week 52. Next run, check the thresholds earlier.",
    "鏡面國的攻陷會翻到自家王城；這是本局目標帶來的反轉，不是所有種子的固定結局。": "Conquering Mirrorland flips onto your own capital. This reversal comes from this run's target, and is not a fixed ending for every seed.",
    "這局沒有單一崩點。把目標、武器部件、補給與攻陷路線一起比較，再調整下局順序。": "This run had no single breaking point. Compare the target, weapon parts, supply choices, and conquest route together, then adjust the order next run.",
    "進行中": "In progress",
    "國王召令還在桌上，這一年尚未收尾。": "The king's orders are still on the table. This year is not over yet.",
    "結局": "Ending",
    "得分": "Score",
    "目標": "Target",
    "未選": "Unchosen",
    "週": "Week",
    "獲救": "Rescued",
    "把這局的目標、戰爭或外交路線、補給選擇、武器部件、暴露與關鍵判定寫進你自己的 memory。這些只是這個 seed 與這套打法的觀察；換目標、難度或種子要重新驗證，不要把一次好運寫成永遠成立的攻略。": "Write this run's target, war or diplomacy route, supply choices, weapon parts, exposure, and key checks into your own memory. These are only observations from this seed and this approach. A different target, difficulty, or seed has to be tested again; do not write one stroke of luck as a guide that always holds.",
    "虾征": "Shrimp Conquest",
    "五十二週，小武器，一場不一定屬於誰的勝利": "Fifty-two weeks, a tiny weapon, and a victory that may not belong to anyone",
    "小人國的璿芃受國王召令，要在一年內選一個大人國攻陷，戰爭或外交都行。買糧或偷取被當成老鼠吃掉的物資，遇見好人與壞蛋，用火柴、頂針、繡花針與發條設計小體型武器。被發現時進入路線閃躲或時機連擊；失敗會被俘，也可能獲救。鏡面國藏著一個指向自家王城的反轉。": "Xuanpeng of Lilliput is under the king's orders: within one year, choose a giant kingdom and conquer it, by war or by diplomacy. Buy rations, or steal supplies the giants will blame on mice. Meet kind strangers and scoundrels. Design a tiny weapon from matchsticks, a thimble, a needle, and a clockspring. When you are spotted, you enter route-and-dodge or timing-and-combo; failure can mean capture, and capture can still mean rescue. Mirrorland hides a reversal that points back at your own capital.",
    "先用 target:bastion|harvest|mirror 選大人國；--content mirror 可直接選定鏡面國。": "First use target:bastion|harvest|mirror to choose a giant kingdom; --content mirror can select Mirrorland directly.",
    "野外行動各花一週與一份糧草。buy 花 3 銀幣回本國買糧；steal 補給較多但會提高暴露與發現率。": "Field actions each cost one week and one ration. buy spends 3 silver to purchase rations at home; steal yields more supply but raises exposure and detection.",
    "scout 取情報與部件，aid 攢善意，earn 賺銀幣；日常會遇到好人或壞蛋，結果寫進 events。": "scout gathers intel and parts, aid builds goodwill, earn makes silver. Daily life may bring a kind stranger or a scoundrel; the results go into events.",
    "design 進工坊，依次 part:frame / part:head / part:drive，再 assemble。威力太低的武器對大人只是抓癢。": "design enters the workshop; take part:frame / part:head / part:drive in order, then assemble. A weapon with too little power is only a tickle to a giant.",
    "raid 走戰爭，negotiate 走外交；status 公開兩條攻陷門檻，達標後用 conquer:war 或 conquer:pact。": "raid takes the war path, negotiate the diplomatic one; status shows both conquest thresholds. Once they are met, use conquer:war or conquer:pact.",
    "被發現用 respond:flee 或 respond:fight。逃跑選 route 再按預告 dodge；迎戰看游標與出手點，用 strike 連擊或 brace。": "When spotted, use respond:flee or respond:fight. To escape, pick a route and then dodge by the warnings; to fight, watch the cursor and the strike point, and use strike for a combo or brace.",
    "小遊戲的時限是狀態內的決策拍數，不讀真實時鐘；非交互 agent 與 seed 回放使用相同輸入。": "The minigame timer is the decision beats inside the state, not a real-world clock. A non-interactive agent and a seeded replay use the same inputs.",
    "被俘後可用 rescue:signal / rescue:ransom / rescue:wait；三次等待失敗才進入俘虜結局。": "After capture, use rescue:signal / rescue:ransom / rescue:wait. Only three failed waits lead to the captive ending.",
    "第五十二週行動後仍未攻陷為逾期。鏡面國的戰爭與外交都會進入鏡國反轉。": "If you have still not conquered after the week-52 action, you are overdue. Both war and diplomacy against Mirrorland enter the Mirror reversal.",
}
